      "title": "Baarbara Estate",
      "handle": "baarbara-estate",
      "body_html": "<p>Coffee beans from Baarbara Estate, roasted to a medium-dark profile, have a wonderful aroma of sweet caramel and dried apricot. We love this coffee’s intense, chocolatey flavour profile. To taste the syrupy, smooth mouthfeel of this coffee, we recommend brewing it as a pour over, an espresso or using an AeroPress, Moka Pot or a French Press. If you’ve enjoyed our coffees from Attikan Estate and Sandalwood Estate, you’ll appreciate the sweet aftertaste and medium acidity of this heavy-bodied coffee.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Recommended Resting Period:<span> </span></strong>8<span> Days</span></p>",
